    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textFrame": "off"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "樹里……どうしたんだ？\r\n難しい顔して……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011004010070,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "うわっ！！\r\nな、なんだ……アンタかよ……",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201100401/2011004010070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "すまん、驚かせたか……\r\n……それよりも樹里、何か悩み事でもあるのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011004010080,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……いや、悩み事……つーか今のは、その\r\n笑顔の練習をしようと思って……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201100401/2011004010080"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011004010090,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "やっぱ、アイドルの基本だし……\r\nそーいうのは、ちゃんと身に付けておかねーとさ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201100401/2011004010090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだったのか……でも\r\n無理に笑顔を作る必要はないっていつも言ってるだろう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "樹里は樹里らしいアイドルになればいい、って……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011004010100,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "まぁ、アンタの言うこともわかるんだけどよ……\r\nでもユニットのメンバーを見てるとさ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201100401/2011004010100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011004010110,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "アタシだけムスッとしてるわけにも\r\nいかねーって思うんだよ",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201100401/2011004010110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか……\r\n樹里は真面目だよなぁ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011004010120,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "う、うるせーなっ！\r\n……け、けどよ……",
    "charAnim1": "anger3",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201100401/2011004010120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011004010130,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "なんか、アンタなりのアドバイスとか……\r\n聞けたら、嬉しいんだけど……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201100401/2011004010130"
  },
  {
    "select": "理由を考えてみよう",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "変顔をしてみる\r\nのはどうだ？",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "真似をするとか……",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "笑顔になりたい理由を考えてみるといいんじゃないか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011004010140,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "どうして、って……\r\nそれは……笑顔を、届けたいから……",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201100401/2011004010140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それじゃあ、その相手のことを想ってみるのはどうだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011004010150,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "アタシが笑顔を届けたい、相手……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201100401/2011004010150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011004010160,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……ファン、ユニットのメンバー\r\nそれから──",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201100401/2011004010160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011004010170,
