    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201100401/2011004010180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あぁ、すごく自然な笑顔だった！\r\nちなみに、最後に思い浮かべたのは誰だったんだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011004010190,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "なっ……！\r\nフ、ファンだよ！！　んなの当たり前だろっ！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201100401/2011004010190"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011004010200,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "ファン、ユニットのメンバー、\r\nそれからやっぱりファンだ！！",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201100401/2011004010200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだったのか……！\r\n樹里は本当にファン想いなんだなぁ……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011004010210,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "は、はぁ？　ちげーよ！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201100401/2011004010210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え？　違うのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011004010220,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "い、いや……違わねーけど……！\r\nあーー！　この話はもう終わりだ終わりっ！！",
