    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201100401/2011004010230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いやいや、変顔のおかげでリラックスできて\r\n自然な笑顔が出るようになるかもしれないぞ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ほら、こんな感じで……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
