    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/201100401/2011004010300"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off"
  },
  {
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "基本ってことなら、\r\nまずは誰かを参考にしてみるのも良いかもな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011004010310,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "真似って……誰のだよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201100401/2011004010310"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うーん……身近で笑顔の得意な……\r\n果穂とかはどうだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011004010320,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "か、果穂の真似……？\r\nそれ、本当に意味あんのか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201100401/2011004010320"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺はあると思うけど……\r\nあ、無理にはやらなくても──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011004010330,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "おい、別に無理とは言ってねー……！\r\n果穂の真似だろ？　見てろよ……",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201100401/2011004010330"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011004010340,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……えへへっ！　アタシ、西城樹里、\r\n17歳の高校２年生ですっ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201100401/2011004010340"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011004010350,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……ど、どうだ！！",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201100401/2011004010350"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "す……すごく良かったぞ！\r\n笑顔もバッチリだ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011004010360,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "ま、まぁな……ナメんなよってことだよ\r\nダテにユニット活動してるわけじゃねーんだ……！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201100401/2011004010360"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011004010370,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……でも、なんとなく掴めた気がするぜ\r\nさんきゅーな、プロデューサー！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201100401/2011004010370"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（……まさか、あの樹里が全力で\r\n果穂の真似をするとは……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
